zzle of olive oil. Cook with the air fryer head at 200 °C for 16 minutes."},"timerMinutes":16,"temperatureC":200},{"text":{"es":"Trituramos los ingredientes para la salsa con la batidora Katana.","en":"Blend the sauce ingredients with the Katana blender."}},{"text":{"es":"Servimos en una ensaladera la lechuga troceada, los tostones, el pollo y la salsa. Mezclamos todo y listo.","en":"In a salad bowl, serve the chopped lettuce, croutons, chicken and sauce. Mix everything together and it's ready."}}]}